  "title": "Spicy Quick-Pickled Cauliflower",
  "description": "Simple, spicy quick-pickled cauliflower is perfect for snacking but also good in a salad, on a sandwich, or in Bloody Marys. The hardest part of this recipe is the wait.",
  "authors": [
